---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
    <head>
        <BaseHead title={`about ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="what i'm up to." />
    </head>
    <body>
        <CornerNav current="about" />
        <main class="homepage-container about-layout">
            <div class="content text-reveal">
                <section
                    class="about-bio text-reveal"
                    style="--reveal-order: 0"
                    aria-label="About me"
                >
                    <div class="about-year" style="--reveal-order: 0">
                        <p>
                            My name is Jadden. I'm an engineer and designer,
                            soon to be based in San Francisco. Here's my
                            provenance:
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="about-year" style="--reveal-order: 1">
                        <p class="about-year-label">2005</p>
                        <p>
                            I was born in Tacloban, in the Philippines. I
                            learned how to walk on the beach because I didn't
                            like falling on my grandma's tiled floors.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="about-year" style="--reveal-order: 2">
                        <p class="about-year-label">2007</p>
                        <p>
                            My family moved to Baltimore, Maryland. I don't remember
                            much from this era. I just remember getting lost in the apartment complex
                            often and missing my parents when one took the night shift.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="about-year" style="--reveal-order: 3">
                        <p class="about-year-label">2010</p>
                        <p>
                            We moved again, this time to Las Vegas. I spent
                            most of my free time playing Minecraft.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            My parents never wanted to buy games for me, so I
                            found an open-source cracked launcher and figured
                            out how to get it running on my own.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            Having the whole internet at my disposal fascinated me.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="about-year" style="--reveal-order: 4">
                        <p class="about-year-label">2017</p>
                        <p>I discovered a few programs:</p>
                        <ul class="about-list">
                            <li>Sony Vegas Pro</li>
                            <li>Adobe After Effects</li>
                            <li>Adobe Photoshop</li>
                        </ul>
                        <p>Then started an obsession in design.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="about-year" style="--reveal-order: 5">
                        <p class="about-year-label">2020</p>
                        <p>
                            I started posting anime edits on @igarakii. The
                            reason was simple: I wanted to see my favorite
                            characters rotate on my screen. The account reached 40k followers in its first few months.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            I also started an editing style that a lot of other editors picked up. I loved being a source of discourse as people would say my "style" was being stolen/overused.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="about-year" style="--reveal-order: 6">
                        <p class="about-year-label">2021</p>
                        <p>
                            I hacked my 3DS and started building custom mechanical keyboards. This is how I got into hardware.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="about-year" style="--reveal-order: 7">
                        <p class="about-year-label">2023</p>
                        <p>
                            I graduated high school and started studying
                            Computer Engineering at Purdue. I was fascinated
                            with the things people are capable of imagining
                            and executing, and I had assumed that meant
                            leaving design behind.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="about-year" style="--reveal-order: 8">
                        <p class="about-year-label">2025</p>
                        <p>
                            I published a game on Steam with my friends. We're still working on games together on the side.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="about-year" style="--reveal-order: 9">
                        <p class="about-year-label">2026</p>
                        <p>
                            I started posting design work on Twitter for fun,
                            and it brought in a lot of freelance clients. I
                            also landed a design engineering internship at a
                            startup.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            Because of that, I opened up {" "}<InlineAvatar
                                src="https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/fruitjamms"
                                alt="jamms github pfp"
                                width={20}
                                height={20}
                                class="inline-avatar"
                            />
                            <HoverPreviewLink
                                client:visible
                                href="https://jam.ms"
                                target="_blank"
                                previewSrc="/img/previews/jamms.webp"
                                previewAlt="jam.ms preview">jamms</HoverPreviewLink
                            >, the
                            game studio I started with my friends, as a broader
                            creative studio. We now take on videos, software, and other
                            design work for clients.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            It's strange to think all of this started with
                            wanting to see anime characters rotate.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="about-year" style="--reveal-order: 10">
                        <p class="about-year-label">2027</p>
                        <p>
                            I'll move to SF and start working at the startup
                            full time.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="about-year" style="--reveal-order: 11">
                        <p>
                            What I make starts from an obsession: a song I
                            can't get out of my head, a scene I keep replaying,
                            a small detail that keeps me up at night.
                        </p>
                        <p>
                            I'm inspired by sincere projects and ideas. The
                            best of them stay with me for a long time, and I
                            want my work to do the same for others.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <p class="mb-8" style="--reveal-order: 12">
                        Reach me: <span class="email"
                            >jadden [at] jam [dot] ms</span
                        >
                    </p>
                    <div style="--reveal-order: 13">
                        <SignatureMotion
                            client:only="react"
                            style={{ marginTop: "1rem" }}
                        />
                    </div>
                </section>
            </div>

            <!-- <aside class="content-sidebar"> -->
            <!-- <section class="favorites-section"> -->
            <!-- <p class="section-heading">Things I like:</p>
                    <ul class="section-list">
                        {
                            favorites.length > 0 ? (
                                favorites.map((entry) => (
                                    <li class="section-item">
                                        <div class="section-row section-row-favorites">
                                            <span class="favorite-topic">
